<title>AUSTRIA: Austria March wholesale prices down 0.1 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Austria March wholesale prices down 0.1 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	    MARCH     FEBRUARY     MARCH 96</p>
<p> Monthly WPI index rise	-0.2	  0.1	     0.6</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr index rise	   -0.1	  0.7	    -0.5</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    100.3	100.5	   104.9</p>
<p>				    Q1 1997</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr index rise	    0.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office reported the Q1 1997 wholesale price index was 100.4 (base 1996). In Q1 1996 the wholesale price index was 104.4 (base 1986), a 0.5 percent drop on the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
